     "type": "key",
     "style": "retenir",
     "title": "SI units and prefixes",
     "md": "The **SI base units** are the **metre (m)**, **kilogram (kg)** and **second (s)**. Derived units: area m², volume m³, speed m/s. Prefixes: **kilo (k) = 10³**, **centi (c) = 10⁻²**, **milli (m) = 10⁻³**, **micro (µ) = 10⁻⁶**. So 1 km = 1000 m, 1 cm = 0.01 m, 1 mm = 0.001 m, 1 g = 0.001 kg. 1 litre = 1000 cm³ = 0.001 m³."
    },
